      "type": "note",
      "position": [
        -300,
        80
      ],
      "params": {
        "text": "ChIP-Seq example: trim paired-end reads, align with Bowtie2, call peaks with MACS2, and preview coverage and peak annotations.\n\nDefaults are the nf-core chipseq S. cerevisiae Spt5 ChIP IP sample SRR5204807 and matched input control SRR5204809, with the yeast genome and gene BED from the same pinned test-dataset revision. These are small upstream test subsets, not a synthetic 2 kb genome. Replace reads, reference, and annotations together for a study."
      },
      "ui": {
        "title": "Notes",
        "color": "#f59e0b"
      }
    },
